From 029e18d5c17ac7fa812061f6ed9e5cbf8c34dd0e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: song <songyiqiang1994@163.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 10:51:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Phase 1: Add command latency extended statistics -
 histogram framework, all-time metrics, and config entries

- Add histogram.h: abstract histogram interface with vtable pattern
- Add histogram_logbucket.c: log-bucket histogram implementation (30 buckets, O(1) insert)
- Add command_stats.c: ext stats lifecycle, latency recording, window aggregation
- server.h: add commandExtStats/slot5s/slotMinute types, fields to redisServer and redisCommand
- server.c: hook into call(), INFO commandstats, serverCron rotation, init and reset
- config.c: add command-latency-tracking (bool) and command-latency-histogram-type (enum)
- Makefile: add histogram_logbucket.o and command_stats.o

Supported metrics: usec_min, usec_max, usec_p95, usec_p99 (all-time),
5-second window (calls, usec, min, avg, max),
1-minute window (calls, usec, min, avg, max, p95, p99),
and cmdstat_-/r/w/o aggregation categories.
